<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia capex growth shows confidence boom-govt.</title>
<headline>Australia capex growth shows confidence boom-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Tuesday data showing a 6.5 percent rise in capital expenditure in the March quarter showed booming business confidence.</p>
<p>&quot;You have a look at the capital expenditure survey that was released today -- it shows booming confidence in Australian business,&quot; Howard told parliament.</p>
</text>
